# Contact form integration boundary
# The quote/contact form currently validates client-side and opens the visitor's
# email client with a prefilled inquiry (no backend needed, no secrets exposed).
# To enable direct delivery (recommended for production), set ONE of the following
# and implement the matching endpoint in `src/utils/submitInquiry.ts`:
#
# Option A — Formspree (simplest, no server code)
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxx
#
# Option B — Custom API (Express / serverless / CRM webhook)
# VITE_INQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://api.example.com/api/inquiries
#
# Never put private API keys in VITE_* variables — they ship to the browser.
# Route private delivery through your own server endpoint instead.
